#import "../template.typ": somatic_page

// PHASE 2 - PAGE 16: INNER CHILD - PROMPTS
// Mirroring technique + Mad-lib structured prompts per Shadow Work Philosopher

#somatic_page(
  title: "Meeting the Child",
  body_text: [
    Close your eyes for a moment. Imagine yourself at age five, six, or seven. You may feel a softening in your chest, or perhaps a sudden tightness in your throat. This is the child, still present in your body, still waiting to be seen.
    
    #v(0.5cm)
    
    #set text(style: "italic", size: 10.5pt)
    
    *1. Think of yourself at age 5-7. Complete this sentence:*
    
    The thing that child needed most—and did not receive—was __________.
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *2. What were you told (directly or indirectly) was "too much" about you?*
    
    I was told I was too __________ *(loud, sensitive, needy, wild, quiet, angry, emotional)*.
    
    The message I received was: "__________."
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))

    #v(0.8cm)
    *3. If your Inner Child could speak to you right now, they would say:*
    
    "I need you to know that __________."
    
    "I wish you would __________."
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
    #v(1em)
    #line(length: 100%, stroke: (dash: "dotted"))
  ],
  image_path: none,
  layout_style: "bottom"
)
